              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The median bank passed 41% of the Fed's 2022-24 hikes to depositors (beta 0.41); loan-heavy banks paid 0.50 and saw margins fall.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#24324D"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Median NIM bottomed at 2.94% in Q1 2022 and is 3.66% now; deposit costs peaked at 2.38%.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#24324D"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "59 of 101 banks raise no risk flag; 10 raise two or more, led by ConnectOne (4).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#24324D"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "29 banks lose margin when rates rise, and rates are rising again (Fed funds 3.88% in October 2026).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#24324D"
                    }
                  }
